mer-reyn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0432,"r5":0.0374,"r1_spy":0.0267,"r5_spy":0.0432}}],"quotes":[{"c":"REYN 2020 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2020-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrea Teixeira","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"REYN 2020 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2020-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jason English","x":"Thank you all for your time and I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"REYN 2020 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"…20% of net revenues from products launched in the last three years; three, build out staffing and rightsizing of capacity; four, additional automation of production and processes; and five, delivery of other standing and new revolution business transformation initiatives. I would like to conclude","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"REYN 2020 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Graham","x":"In addition, we are experiencing operational and supply chain inefficiencies arising from operating in a high demand environment, delays in certain cost savings programs and other factors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"REYN 2020 Q3","e":"reyn","d":"2020-11-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jason English","x":"I'll pass it on","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q3-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2020 Q3","e":"reyn","d":"2020-11-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Graham","x":"Based on these expectations, we have increased our guidance and we expect the following for the full year 2020; net revenue to be in the range of $3.24 billion to $3.26 billion, adjusted EBITDA to be in the range of $715 million to $720 million, adjusted EPS to be in the range of $1.95 to $1.97…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q3-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2020 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2021-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"…pricing and we've modeled the elasticity impacts across our business, we'll continue to focus on our core mission of serving retailer partners and consumers, innovating protecting profitability and delivering growth and we have already implemented one price increase in that product line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2020 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2021-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"So it's important that we are saying, very clearly here -- we are going to take price to offset commodity costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2020 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"…that we're employing to ensure that we protect our profitability in addition to price, that includes cost reduction initiatives that we have a revolution manufacturing productivity initiatives and other actions that we can take from a cost standpoint, which we will also be employing those levers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"We expect four factors to drive even stronger growth over the balance of the year, those are: Consumer consumption, Price increases, Innovation, and our increased supply chain capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"Our brand and product portfolio are strong, positioning us well for price increases in one of the toughest commodity cycles, that I've ever seen.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2021-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Andrea Teixeira","x":"And on the innovation or the cost restructuring, the revolution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2021-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"I'm committed to implementing price increases, that fully offset material cost increases at a pace and amount appropriate to market conditions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2021-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"They are; consumer demand, price increases, innovation and strengthened manufacturing and supply chain capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2021-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"We will also talk about Revolution cost savings, which are tracking ahead of plan, and remain another significant source of margin recovery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2021-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"We have the brands, the product portfolio, category management team, the manufacturing and supply chain capabilities, the pricing actions, the cost-savings, and most of all, the people, to position us for substantial improvement in earnings growth in the fourth quarter and over the long-term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q3","e":"reyn","d":"2021-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"And we continue to expand participating on third-party marketplaces, while also testing and launching direct to consumer initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q3","e":"reyn","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"I remain, firmly committed to implementing price increases to offset material cost increases at a pace and amount appropriate to market conditions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q3","e":"reyn","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"They are consumer demand, price increases, innovation and expanded manufacturing and supply chain capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q3","e":"reyn","d":"2021-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"Michael will also talk through revolution cost savings, which are tracking ahead of plan and remain a significant source of margin recovery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q3","e":"reyn","d":"2021-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"Increased investment in automation is a major contributor to revolution cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2022-02-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"We tested holiday-themed product bundles, and we continue to expand participating in third-party marketplaces while also continuing work on multiple direct-to-consumer initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/09/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2022-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"Our four rounds of price increases since late 2020 have been implemented as planned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/09/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2022-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"We expect consumer demand, price increases, innovation, and expanded manufacturing and supply chain capabilities to remain our main drivers of growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/09/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2022-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"We also accelerated Reyvolution cost savings in 2021 and begin increasing our emphasis on Reyvolution growth and cost savings initiatives strengthening our earnings potential for 2022 and the long term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/09/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2021 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2022-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Graham","x":"We anticipate significant additional Reyvolution cost savings in 2022 and continued capital investment in high-return programs that improve our cost structure beyond 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/09/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2022 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2022-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Graham","x":"Net revenues in the first quarter were $845 million, an increase of 12% on top of the record first quarter net revenues of $757 million in 2021, primarily driven by price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/10/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2022 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2022-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Graham","x":"Adjusted EBITDA for the first quarter was $112 million, down 20% versus last year's first quarter adjusted EBITDA of $140 million, driven by higher material, manufacturing, logistics, and advertising costs, as well as lower volume, which was significantly offset by price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/10/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2022 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2022-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lance Mitchell","x":"…categories, waste bags, disposable tableware, and private label food bags, additional pricing and cost savings in our plan to restore pre-pandemic profitability, and improve staffing service and retailer in stocks. Turning to our main drivers of growth pricing, consumer demand, innovation, and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/10/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2022 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2022-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Swartzberg","x":"So we set out to deliver a little more than two points of margin improvement through revolution cost savings in 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/10/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2022 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2022-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Graham","x":"Net revenues in the second quarter were $917 million, an increase of 5% over second quarter net revenues of $873 million in 2021, primarily driven by price increases and partially offset by a decline in volume.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/09/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2022 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2022-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Graham","x":"Significant price increases across our entire portfolio offset all material cost increases and a large portion of increases in manufacturing and logistics costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/09/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2022 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2022-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Graham","x":"And we are expanding revolution cost savings based on our comprehensive business review, identifying and targeting additional procurement, manufacturing and logistic savings, giving us added scope for investment in margin growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/09/reynolds-consumer-products-inc-reyn-q2-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"REYN 2025 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2026-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Huckins","x":"We delivered sequential quarterly improvement throughout the year, mitigating escalating commodity, tariff, and consumer headwinds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/reynolds-reyn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2025 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2026-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Nathan Lowe","x":"The impact of pricing to recover commodities and tariffs and growth in our low-margin non-retail business had a dilutive impact on gross margin percentages to the tune of 190 basis points, masking the underlying improvement in profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/reynolds-reyn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2025 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2026-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Huckins","x":"This disciplined approach produced results as evidenced in the foil category, where price gaps with store brands narrowed throughout the year, even as we successfully covered commodity pressure with substantial price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/reynolds-reyn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2025 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2026-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Huckins","x":"For 2026, we have already implemented a price increase in January and are anticipating further adjustments for the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/reynolds-reyn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2025 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2026-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Huckins","x":"These priorities span growth and innovation, productivity initiatives across manufacturing and supply chain, and other cost savings programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/reynolds-reyn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2025 Q4","e":"reyn","d":"2026-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nathan Lowe","x":"We delivered cost savings through productivity initiatives, strategic sourcing, and disciplined cost management.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/reynolds-reyn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2026 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Nathan Lowe","x":"And as we moved through the last year, the tariff headwinds really shifted more to [ 232 ] tariffs and the aluminum increases, which are out of scope for the Supreme Court billing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/reynolds-reyn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2026 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Unknown Analyst","x":"And one quick question on tariffs i.e., PA refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/reynolds-reyn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2026 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Huckins","x":"The Foil category remains resilient with net elasticity below 1, reflecting that consumers are largely absorbing price increases rather than exiting the category.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/reynolds-reyn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2026 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Huckins","x":"…macro uncertainty, and cautious consumer outlook, we believe we are well positioned to stay within our existing full year 2026 earnings guidance range with robust market momentum, ongoing efficiency gains and strong pricing power compensating for the incremental cost pressure we expect to face.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/reynolds-reyn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2026 Q1","e":"reyn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nathan Lowe","x":"The manufacturing and broader cost savings initiatives we discussed last year are progressing well, supporting current earnings performance and positioning us to help offset potential elasticity impacts as the year progresses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/reynolds-reyn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"REYN 2026 Q2","e":"reyn","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Nathan Lowe","x":"Q2 revenue of $944 millio